  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A treason investigation involving former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and five other individuals is currently underway. Indonesian police authorities have formally named the six individuals as suspects following a series of raids across 14 locations, including five sites identified as operation posts in Cibinong. Evidence gathered by the police reportedly includes digital analysis documents, charts outlining alleged strategies, and materials referencing the 1998 political crisis when President Soeharto resigned. Law enforcement officials have also identified six social media accounts suspected of launching cyberattacks against the government. Public discourse has emerged regarding the scope of the investigation, with political figures calling for a thorough inquiry into the ultimate origin of the alleged illegal wiretapping operations targeting President Prabowo Subianto. The suspects face potential severe penalties, including the death penalty, under current allegations.",
